                <head>[Received October 22, 1866.—Translation.]</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Office for Foreign Affairs,</hi>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Buenos Ayres,</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1866-10-22"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >October</hi> 22, 1866</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>The minister for foreign affairs has the honor to invite General Alexander
                    Asboth, minister resident of the United States of America, to a conference at
                    his office to-morrow, the 23d instant, at 1 o’clock p. m.</p>
            </div>
